      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Two thoughts.\n\nOne: 302 redirect is at the http level. 302 is a http response code. So you should delete the remark about the issue being dns level, unless you're interested in arguing.\n\nA redirect at dns level would be handled, see CNAME record type.\n\nTwo: https://creators.vrchat.com/worlds/udon/image-loading/ the documentation does say that redirect is treated as an error.\n\nSo, working as intended, not a bug.",
